abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark and systems prototype for evaluating speculative decoding,
  batching, KV caching, resource scheduling, failure recovery, and tenant isolation under
  multi-agent LLM workflow workloads in distributed cloud environments.
keywords:
  - large language model serving
  - multi-agent systems
  - distributed inference
  - KV cache
  - multi-tenancy
  - failure recovery
